# PlantUML rendering server.
#
# Read at BUILD time by Vite and inlined into the client bundle, so changing it
# requires a rebuild (`bun run generate`) — setting it at runtime has no effect.
#
# Defaults:
#   - `bun run dev`:   http://localhost:8081 — start it with `docker compose up -d plantuml`.
#   - Docker image:    /plantuml (set in the Dockerfile) — nginx proxies this to the
#     plantuml service in docker-compose.yml, so no PlantUML port needs to be public.
#
# Point this at a remote server only if you accept the disclosure: the diagram text
# is deflate+base64 encoded into the request URL path, which is trivially
# reversible — that server receives the full source of every diagram your readers view.
#
# VITE_PLANTUML_SERVER=https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml
